[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4680.79, "timestamp": "01:18:00", "text": "毒品，骑师？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4683.75, "timestamp": "01:18:03", "text": "我的意思是，如果你说的是雪茄的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4687.75, "timestamp": "01:18:07", "text": "抽烟之类的。是的。呃，有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4690.47, "timestamp": "01:18:10", "text": "有一次，我还在上高中的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4693.43, "timestamp": "01:18:13", "text": "我被迫这么做的。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4695.35, "timestamp": "01:18:15", "text": "以前喜欢那种为了融入群体而做的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4698.11, "timestamp": "01:18:18", "text": "是的。是的。嗯，是的。为了融入和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4703.03, "timestamp": "01:18:23", "text": "东西。但是，是的。所以我们过去常常用它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4705.83, "timestamp": "01:18:25", "text": "他身体很差。这听起来会很刺耳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4709.11, "timestamp": "01:18:29", "text": "真恶心，不过，我们以前确实会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4712.229, "timestamp": "01:18:32", "text": "用过的废弃香烟。所以，东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4717.03, "timestamp": "01:18:37", "text": "老兄。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4718.55, "timestamp": "01:18:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4722.95, "timestamp": "01:18:42", "text": "我的天啊。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4725.99, "timestamp": "01:18:45", "text": "我的天啊。而且，我们以前还经常卷烟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4727.669, "timestamp": "01:18:47", "text": "文件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4730.229, "timestamp": "01:18:50", "text": "是的。用普通的卷烟纸卷着抽就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4734.709, "timestamp": "01:18:54", "text": "是的。是的。我的天啊。那甚至都不算什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4737.43, "timestamp": "01:18:57", "text": "好的。我不能怪你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4739.99, "timestamp": "01:18:59", "text": "我也这样做过。"}]